6. References & Learning Resources
For engineers new to Flowable, please review the official documentation below:

Getting Started:

Flowable Open Source Home - Overview of the ecosystem.

Getting Started Guide - A 10-minute tutorial on deploying a simple process.

Core Documentation:

BPMN 2.0 User Guide - For structured flows like Retention Offers.

CMMN 1.1 User Guide - For ad-hoc "Case Management" flows used in Assisted Servicing.

Development:

Spring Boot Integration - How to configure the embedded engine in our microservices.

REST API Swagger Docs - Reference for the out-of-the-box APIs.
